## 🔧 QUICK FIXES

**Git push fails "not found":**
```powershell
git remote remove origin
git remote add origin https://github.com/pangenitor72-prog/dev-lab-setup.git
```

**Ollama out of memory:**
- Close Chrome/games
- Use Q4 quantization (not Q5/Q8)
- Try 3B model instead

**Import errors:**
```powershell
.\venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

